nd which direction, east or west", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T22:25:32Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "The Horocones and Vacas rivers originate from it", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T22:25:32Z", "username": "pratik.s.chandarana", "text": "Yes", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T22:25:44Z", "username": "pratik.s.chandarana", "text": "Exactly", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-25T22:25:48Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "They're full rivers", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]